{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IT HAS YOUR FACE</strong>. Now it wants your life. Hide, seek, and try to kill your clone in this deceptively simple first-person horror roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR CLONE</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your clone is hiding among the crowd, ready to kill you when you\u2019re most vulnerable. Endure procedural paranoia as you search to find your doppelganger before they find you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/1572260532356d8dde1d3689152e1559.poster.avif?t=1771684050\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/1572260532356d8dde1d3689152e1559.webm?t=1771684050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/1572260532356d8dde1d3689152e1559.mp4?t=1771684050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>KILL YOUR CLONE</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for weapons, manage limited ammo, and prepare carefully to strike. If your assassination fails, you\u2019ll lose the opportunity to stalk from the shadows.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/f2e03cf8be5aeb51a667a5791e5e5c17.poster.avif?t=1771684050\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/f2e03cf8be5aeb51a667a5791e5e5c17.webm?t=1771684050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/f2e03cf8be5aeb51a667a5791e5e5c17.mp4?t=1771684050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>BIOLOGICAL HORRORS</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll gain a greater understanding of your cursed fate and reveal terrifying new threats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ebbfca69ef3503245f39b30638d20c7a.poster.avif?t=1771684050\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ebbfca69ef3503245f39b30638d20c7a.webm?t=1771684050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ebbfca69ef3503245f39b30638d20c7a.mp4?t=1771684050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BETTER YOU</strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite elements offer upgrades and improvements, giving you greater flexibility to endure increasingly complex challenges.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/798128f494bd1ee201881f8d60567214.poster.avif?t=1771684050\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/798128f494bd1ee201881f8d60567214.webm?t=1771684050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/798128f494bd1ee201881f8d60567214.mp4?t=1771684050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER MAYHEM</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By popular demand, the Early Access version will include a PVP mode. Play hide and seek and eliminate your friends in this game of 1 v (the same) 1.\u00a0\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/c5b2dff513066071d6e2b057fe3dbfb8.poster.avif?t=1771684050\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/c5b2dff513066071d6e2b057fe3dbfb8.webm?t=1771684050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/c5b2dff513066071d6e2b057fe3dbfb8.mp4?t=1771684050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capsule Art by Treeink</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Replaced","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506530/95311197bbb65debf4ac8b15419758dd9eb79793.jpg"},{"name":"There Can Be Only One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506530/537da0ed05b0530d051a04a43afd0ba2514b7de0.jpg"},{"name":"It Has My Face","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506530/124f1c9fde04f14d8cf39453c09acf332d7a038e.jpg"},{"name":"Horrors Among Us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506530/52c4eeeae2d6dfc94c87d5e826ffca582154d066.jpg"},{"name":"A Certain Frequency","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2506530/8107b6b8b2f83224ed01d5407800572c8cb1d85a.jpg"},{"name":"Project For Humanity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic